<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle sees double-digit profit growth.</title>
<headline>Nestle sees double-digit profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helmut Maucher, chairman and chief executive of Nestle SA, said he expected 1997 to be a good year with profits and sales likely to grow by a double-digit amount.</p>
<p>&quot;We are looking forward probably to a double-digit growth in sales and profits,&quot; Maucher told Reuters Financial Television about the current year.</p>
<p>&quot;We are expecting a very good year and this year of course the currency should help us,&quot; Maucher added.</p>
<p>He also said Nestle's coffee business was going well.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
